/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `p _ σ n' _ om om' b0 bv t x _hb0 hbv ht hx hlaS htx hsim`. Establish `hxS : HasSubst x` using `hasSubst_of_constantCoeff_zero fun r => (hx r).2`. Establish `htS : HasSubst t` using `hasSubst_of_constantCoeff_zero ht`. Establish `hzcc : ∀ s : ZMod n', constantCoeff (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.zOm (d` using `n') σ om om' s) = 0 := by`. Introduce `s`.

Rewrite using `[← hlaS s]`. Conclude with `constantCoeff_subst_eq_zero htS ht (GlobalTheory.BeProps.constantCoeff_laS s)`. Establish `hzS : HasSubst (fun s : ZMod n' => GlobalTheory.ThBe0.zOm σ om om' s)` using `hasSubst_of_constantCoeff_zero hzcc`. Establish `hzOm : ∀ s : ZMod n', subst x (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.zOm (d` using `n') σ om om' s) = GlobalTheory.ThStr.laS p n' s := by`. Introduce `s`.

Rewrite using `[← hlaS s, subst_comp_subst_apply htS hxS]`. Establish `: (fun r => subst x (t r)) = (X : ZMod n' → MvPowerSeries (ZMod n') ℂ_[p])` using `funext htx`. Rewrite using `[this, subst_self]`. Both sides reduce to the same expression. Establish `hFx : subst x (subst (fun s : ZMod n' => GlobalTheory.ThBe0.zOm σ om om' s) bv) = subst (GlobalTheory.ThStr.laS p n') bv`.

Rewrite using `[subst_comp_subst_apply hzS hxS]`. Use `congr 1`. Use function extensionality and compare the values at `s`. Conclude with `hzOm s`. Establish `hGx : subst x (∑ r : Fin (n' / 2), GlobalTheory.ThBe0.at2 b0 (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.lg (Sum.inl r)) (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.lg (Sum.inr r))) = ∑ r : Fin (n' / 2), GlobalTheory.ThBe0.at2 b0 (PowerSeries.subst (x (Sum.inl r)) (Formalism.MainNotions.GL3Theta.logF p)) (PowerSeries.subst (x …`.

Rewrite using `[← coe_substAlgHom hxS, map_sum]`. Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun r _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Rewrite using `[coe_substAlgHom hxS, GlobalTheory.ThBe0.Inhab.subst_powerSeriesEvalTwoGroups hxS (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.Inhab.cc_lg _) (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.Inhab.cc_lg _)]`. Simplify using `only [GlobalTheory.ThBe0.lg]`. Rewrite using `[GlobalTheory.ThBe0.Inhab.subst_psubst hxS (constantCoeff_X _), GlobalTheory.ThBe0.Inhab.subst_psubst hxS (constantCoeff_X _), subst_X hxS, subst_X hxS]`.

Take `⟨hD0, hDint⟩` from `hsim`. Use `set F := subst (fun s : ZMod n' => GlobalTheory.ThBe0.zOm σ om om' s) bv with hF`. Use `set G := ∑ r : Fin (n' / 2), GlobalTheory.ThBe0.at2 b0 (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.lg (Sum.inl r)) (GlobalTheory.ThBe0.lg (Sum.inr r)) with hG`. Establish `ccL : constantCoeff (subst (GlobalTheory.ThStr.laS p n') bv) = 0` using `constantCoeff_subst_eq_zero (hasSubst_of_constantCoeff_zero fun s => GlobalTheory.BeProps.constantCoeff_laS s) (fun s => GlobalTheory.BeProps.constantCoeff_laS s) hbv`. Establish `ccD : constantCoeff (subst x (F - G)) = 0` using `constantCoeff_subst_eq_zero hxS (fun r => (hx r).2) hD0`.

Establish `hneg : -(subst x G) = subst x (F - G) + -(subst (GlobalTheory.ThStr.laS p n') bv)`. Rewrite using `[subst_sub hxS, hFx]`. Expand and normalize the polynomial expressions, which then agree. Use `⟨subst x (Formalism.MainNotions.TaylorLogMetric.expMv (F - G)), ?_, ?_⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Conclude with `GlobalTheory.SubringSeries.subst_mem (A := Formalism.MainNotions.GL3Theta.Wp p) hxS (fun r => (hx r).1) hDint`.

Rewrite using `[← hGx, hneg] show PowerSeries.subst _ (PowerSeries.exp ℂ_[p]) = _ * PowerSeries.subst _ (PowerSeries.exp ℂ_[p])`. Rewrite using `[ReciprocityTheory.ChartRestriction.G.TB.WickVanishing.exp_add ccD (by rw [map_neg, ccL, neg_zero]), GlobalTheory.BeProps.expMv_eq_subst hD0, ReciprocityTheory.ChartRestriction.G.TB.WickVanishing.subst_exp x (fun r => (hx r).2) hD0]`.
